# Implementation Plan - Sprint 1.3: Knowledge Governance Foundation

This plan implements Sprint 1.3, establishing persistent document metadata, governance APIs, and synchronizing metadata updates with vector search indexing (Pinecone).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dynamic Vector Database Synced Deletes:** When a new version of an existing file (same name and category) is uploaded, any existing chunks of that document will be automatically pruned from Pinecone using a filter metadata-delete query. This ensures that Pinecone does not store duplicate or orphaned chunks if the document contents shrink in size.
> 
> **Database Environment Mapping:** As verified in Sprint 1.2, we will use `process.env.MONGODB_DB` (or fallback to `process.env.MONGO_DB_NAME`) resolved dynamically in `mongoClient.js` to ensure the collection resides in the correct database without hardcoding.

